WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 079. SEARCH RESULT ≠ EVIDENCE MAP. Keywords can miss the question.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
DIMENSIONS. QUESTION. POPULATION. CONTEXT. OUTCOME. Test relevance explicitly.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
QUALIFY. TYPE. QUALITY. APPLICABILITY. Keep these judgments separate.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
RETAIN. SOURCE. LIMIT. UNKNOWN. Show what does not fit.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. NAVIGATION DOES NOT DECIDE. Synthetic evidence only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. FIND WHAT ANSWERS. Keep every source and limit attached.
